      "type": "dialogue",
      "section": "act2",
      "scene": "scene-6",
      "speaker": "maya",
      "direction": null,
      "text": "But there's a real tension here. Openness accelerates capability. And capability without guardrails... DARIUS ...is the thing everyone's quietly terrified about. Yeah.",
